# Minimal dashboard distribution: keep the report and its public presentation.
# Development files, additional data exports, caches, packages and other media stay local.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/LICENSE

# The PBIX contains the model, report, theme and dummy data needed to launch.
!/dashboard/
/dashboard/*
!/dashboard/ModelRisk.pbix
!/dashboard/ModelRisk_RawData.txt

# Preserve the animated preview embedded in the README.
!/docs/
/docs/*
!/docs/media/
/docs/media/*
!/docs/media/walkthrough.gif
